request.description:
Save-and-submit — vendor's "Publish" button.

Empty body is valid if all fields already filled in prior PATCHes. Backend runs completeness check on the final row.

**Missing fields → 400 PROPERTY_INCOMPLETE:**
```
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Property is missing required fields to submit for review.",
  "details": {
    "code": "PROPERTY_INCOMPLETE",
    "missingFields": ["shortDescription (min 20 chars)", "mainImage"]
  }
}
```

